ets/steam/apps/1174030/extras/420e9d77ca305118c72ff7f5bc0e25a3.webm?t=1727715780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174030/extras/420e9d77ca305118c72ff7f5bc0e25a3.mp4?t=1727715780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Level heroes up to increase their Strength, Agility, Faith, or Magic.  Different heroes and weapons scale with different statistics.  There is a level cap to help maintain balanced game play and prevent the need for excessive grinding.  As your team rank increases, by beating missions for the first time, the level cap will raise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies will behave in learnable ways:  figure out how to avoid or mitigate their skills and attacks.  Some enemies will just try to attack whatever is closest, some will focus on whomever has dealt them the most damage, and so on. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174030/extras/92a64114cc04d13f826c91feeaa2a477.poster.avif?t=1727715780\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174030/extras/92a64114cc04d13f826c91feeaa2a477.webm?t=1727715780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174030/extras/92a64114cc04d13f826c91feeaa2a477.mp4?t=1727715780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Create your party from a pool of up to 25 unique heroes that each have unique skills.  You'll unlock more heroes as you increase your team rank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174030/extras/9d6a24efc892bbc1a68e55b9fcd8f562.webp?t=1727715780\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your choices matter:  as you play through the game you'll be given several choices that will effect things yet to come including influencing what ending you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle against 50 unique enemies.  View detailed stats and descriptions for the enemies you've battled in the Bestiary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174030/extras/a48dec627b1631b651c22e209ab60cb5.poster.avif?t=1727715780\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174030/extras/a48dec627b1631b651c22e209ab60cb5.webm?t=1727715780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Hero Lodge was created by a Solo Developer including all art and music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174030/extras/7120f0015b80e2d5e8e79494d63f4c13.poster.avif?t=1727715780\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174030/extras/7120f0015b80e2d5e8e79494d63f4c13.webm?t=1727715780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174030/extras/7120f0015b80e2d5e8e79494d63f4c13.mp4?t=1727715780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
